zvf","https://x.com/rohanpaul_ai/status/2120991673878786311"],"articles":[{"id":"kl6usb0zdu045w9bedy6qyzvf","title":"涉华芯片关联公司投资DeepSeek融资","originalTitle":"","summary":"","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/kl6usb0zdu045w9bedy6qyzvf","originalUrl":"https://x.com/rohanpaul_ai/status/2120991673878786311","publishedAt":"2026-11-20T11:00:05.000Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":"2026-11-20T11:00:05.000Z","datePrecision":"discovered","sourceId":"aihot-1sngkqe","originalSourceName":"X：Rohan Paul (@rohanpaul_ai)","family":"outlet-1lanm2l","kind":"community","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/kl6usb0zdu045w9bedy6qyzvf","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-20T12:47:25.982Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-1sngkqe","name":"X：Rohan Paul (@rohanpaul_ai)","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-20T12:47:25.982Z"}],"story":{"publicId":"c4010e0b-ceb4-4081-bb9a-9c40af7f311e","title":"涉华芯片关联公司投资DeepSeek融资","status":"active","sourceCount":2,"reportCount":2,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-12T21:26:35.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-20T11:00:05.000Z","latest":"DeepSeek 完成第二轮融资 融资 140-150 亿美元 投后估值约 860 亿美元","digest":"据 X 用户 Rohan Paul 转引《华尔街日报》报道，与 Alice Huang 相关的公司投资了 DeepSeek 最新一轮融资，并承诺提供 Nvidia 芯片，目标是成为 DeepSeek 稳定的被禁 Blackwell 芯片供应商。\n\n该转引报道称，Alice Huang 的丈夫、商人 Kang Wei 与 Nvidia 首席执行官黄仁勋相识十年，两人于 2023 年在新加坡成立 Megaspeed，以无法直接购买此类芯片的阿里巴巴作为锚定客户，换取 Nvidia 芯片优先供应；2024 年底至 2025 年 6 月间，该公司向潜在投资者承诺三年三倍回报，并称有办法将 Nvidia 芯片带入中国。上述说法均来自该转引报道。\n\n另一 X 账号 X.PIN 称，DeepSeek 已完成第二轮融资，融资 140–150 亿美元，投后估值约 860 亿美元；一家由 31 个合伙人组成的投资载体进入其股东结构，腾讯和宁德时代是最大的外部投资方，其次是中国移动和中信证券。该报道未提及 Alice Huang 相关公司是否在其中。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-20T11:16:32.605Z","links":{"aihot":"https://aihot.news/story/c4010e0b-ceb4-4081-bb9a-9c40af7f311e"},"reports":[{"id":"jmo8g1e3282ie12oa3vxq0dnw","title":"DeepSeek 完成第二轮融资 融资 140-150 亿美元 投后估值约 860 亿美元","summary":"DeepSeek 完成第二轮融资，融资 140-150 亿美元，投后估值约 860 亿美元。一家由 31 个合伙人组成的投资载体进入其股东结构，腾讯和宁德时代是最大的外部投资方，其次是中国移动和中信证券。","source":{"name":"X：X.PIN (@thexpin)","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-20T11:00:05.000Z","links":{"aihot":"https://aihot.news/items/jmo8g1e3282ie12oa3vxq0dnw","original":"https://x.com/thexpin/status/2123733110756159769"}},{"id":"kl6usb0zdu045w9bedy6qyzvf","title":"与 Alice Huang 相关的公司投资 DeepSeek 最新融资，并承诺提供 Nvidia 芯片","summary":"据称与 Alice Huang 相关的公司投资了 DeepSeek 的最新融资轮，目标是成为 DeepSeek 稳定的被禁 Blackwell 芯片供应商。作者转引 WSJ 报道称，Alice Huang 的丈夫、商人 Kang Wei 与 Jensen Huang 相识十年，两人 2023 年在新加坡成立 Megaspeed，以被禁止直接购买此类芯片的阿里巴巴为锚定客户换取 Nvidia 芯片优先供应，并在 2024 年底至 2025 年 6 月间向潜在投资者承诺 3 年三倍回报，称有办法将 Nvidia 芯片带入中国。","source":{"name":"X：Rohan Paul (@rohanpaul_ai)","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-12T21:26:35.000Z","links":{"aihot":"https://aihot.news/items/kl6usb0zdu045w9bedy6qyzvf","original":"https://x.com/rohanpaul_ai/status/2120991673878786311"}}],"storyline":[],"related":[]},"storyStatus":"ok"}}]}
